## Practical Example

Consider two customers with different rate limits:

| Customer   | GET /v1/api1 | POST /v2/group1 | DELETE /v2/group1 |
|------------|--------------|-----------------|-------------------|
| Customer A | 100/hour     | 50/hour         | N/A               |
| Customer B | 200/hour     | N/A             | 20/hour           |

### Setup

1. **API Products**
   - Product 1: `/v1/api1` (GET), with attribute `quota_get_v1_api1`.
   - Product 2: `/v2/group1` (POST, DELETE), with attributes `quota_post_v2_group1` and `quota_delete_v2_group1`.

2. **Developer Apps**
   - Customer A: `quota_get_v1_api1=100`, `quota_post_v2_group1=50`.
   - Customer B: `quota_get_v1_api1=200`, `quota_delete_v2_group1=20`.

3. **Proxy Configuration**

   ```xml
   <Quota name="Dynamic-Quota">
       <Interval>1</Interval>
       <TimeUnit>hour</TimeUnit>
       <Identifier ref="client_id"/>
       <Allow countRef="developer.app.quota_get_v1_api1"/>
       <Condition>(request.verb = "GET" and request.uri.path = "/v1/api1")</Condition>
   </Quota>
   <Quota name="Dynamic-Quota-Post">
       <Interval>1</Interval>
       <TimeUnit>hour</TimeUnit>
       <Identifier ref="client_id"/>
       <Allow countRef="developer.app.quota_post_v2_group1"/>
       <Condition>(request.verb = "POST" and request.uri.path = "/v2/group1")</Condition>
   </Quota>
   <Quota name="Dynamic-Quota-Delete">
       <Interval>1</Interval>
       <TimeUnit>hour</TimeUnit>
       <Identifier ref="client_id"/>
       <Allow countRef="developer.app.quota_delete_v2_group1"/>
       <Condition>(request.verb = "DELETE" and request.uri.path = "/v2/group1")</Condition>
   </Quota>
   ```

